    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_add_title">添加电脑</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_add_why">Persona 在你的电脑上替你干活：看文件、跑命令、用那台电脑上的 Claude Code。先接上一台，Mac、Windows、Linux 都可以。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_add_how">在那台电脑上打开网页版 Persona，进「机器」页点「添加电脑」，按提示装好 Persona Link，它会自己连上来。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_add_note">电脑连上以后，这里会自己变好。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_wake_title">叫醒%1$s</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_wake_body">%1$s现在不在线，可能睡着了，或者上面的 Persona Link 没开。打开盖子或唤醒它，确认 Persona Link 在运行。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_wake_after">连上以后这里会自己变好。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_install_title">安装 Claude Code</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_install_body">在%1$s上打开终端，粘贴下面这行，回车：</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_install_after">装好以后回到这里，过一会儿就会变好。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_login_title">登录 Claude Code</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_login_body">在%1$s上打开终端，输入下面这个词，回车，按提示在浏览器里登录一次：</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_login_after">登录好以后回到这里，发一句试试。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_what_title">Persona 能做什么</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_what_body">Persona 是你的私人助手。接好电脑和模型以后，它能：</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_what_computer">• 在你的电脑上看文件、跑命令、替你动手（动手前会先问你）</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_what_data">• 看你的日程、邮件、飞书和收件箱，帮你整理、草拟回复</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_what_memory">• 记住聊过的事，下次接着来</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_model_title">怎么接模型</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_model_body">Persona 要一个能用的模型才能回答。两种方式选一种：</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_model_key">• 有 API Key：在「设置 › 模型供应商」里选一家，粘贴 Key，会自动测试。</string>
    <string name="designsystem_readiness_help_model_claude">• 已经在用 Claude Code：在那台电脑上登录一次就行，不用再填什么。</string>
</resources>
